A quick relevant note: Ilya has been slowly moving point-based microclimate modeling in vegetated systems from microclimc <https://48b294cf.streaklinks.com/CVy3yBltLcu6aIuRAgoyaAdf/https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Filyamaclean%2Fmicroclimc> to micropoint <https://48b294cf.streaklinks.com/CVy3yBpQ0N7jRkoKcAjaXeZb/https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Filyamaclean%2Fmicropoint>. microclimc is still fully functional but in a few years one might be better off with micropoint (which will feed in more directly to microclimf <https://48b294cf.streaklinks.com/CVy3yBpurjnJM-2edA4DBWcX/https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Filyamaclean%2Fmicroclimf%2F>), once we've caught the bugs.

Best,
Dave
